*** Keywords ***
TC 4 Cells 4 UEs
    [Documentation]                 Configures the TL, verifies the cells setup, initiates and check DL/UL Traffic.
    [Arguments]                     ${param}
    Init Sequence                   ${param}
    Critical Step                   Get TL Type
    Critical Step                   Apply Custom Config for 4 Cells Configuration
    Step                            sleep               argument=300s
    Critical Step                   Restart TL
    Step                            Save Current Configuration
    Critical Step                   Step Setup LTEemu
    Critical Step                   Test Verify Cell Setup
    Step                            Test Perform Attach
    Critical Step                   Test Verify Attach for 4 UEs on 4 Sectors
    Step                            Test DL traffic for 4 Ues on 4 Sectors
    Step                            Test UL traffic for 4 Ues on 4 Sectors
    sleep                           30


Get TL Type
    [Documentation]                 Check the topology and set TL_Type and Apply_CustomConfig variables
    Dated Log                       TL type is: ${GNB_DU.profil}_AP_${AP_DU.profil}
    ${NoCustomConfig}               Set Variable        ${True}
    Run Keyword If                  '${GNB_DU.profil}'=='LO' and '${AP_DU.profil}'=='LO'
    ...                                 Run Keywords    Set Global Variable     ${NoCustomConfig}   ${False}
    ...                                 AND             Set Global Variable     ${TL_Type}          LO_AP_LO
    ...         ELSE                Should be true      ${False}    ERROR: Unknown Topology !!!


Apply Custom Config for 4 Cells Configuration
    [Documentation]                 If a custom config is required, then apply the custom config files.
    Return from keyword if          ${NoCustomConfig}
    OperatingSystem.Run             rm -f /tmp/Delivered_iphy.xml
    OperatingSystem.Run             rm -f /tmp/iphy.xml
    Dated Log                       ${param.TestName} Custom Config: In progress...
    Apply Custom Config             scfc=${${param.TestName}_scfc}
    ...                             iphy=${${param.TestName}_iphy}
    ...                             cfg=${${param.TestName}_cfg}
    OperatingSystem.Run             rm -f /tmp/${param.TestName}_iphy.xml
    OperatingSystem.Run             rm -f /tmp/iphy.xml
    Dated Log                       ${param.TestName} Custom Config: DONE.


Step Setup LTEemu
    [Documentation]                 Clean WTS, restart and configure ePC simulator in order to get X2 link eNB and gNB.
    WTS Setup                       shouldUseLua=${False}
    ...                             nbCell=${NB_CELLS}


Test Verify Cell Setup
    [Documentation]                 Check the Cell Setup on Airphone side
    Verify cell setup per cell


Test Verify Max Number Of NR Cell Group
   [Documentation]                 Check the number of cell groups on gNB side
    ${isPoolingActivated}           Get BB Pooling status
   ${valueToCheck}                 set variable if     '${isPoolingActivated}'=='true'   ${LO_LO_NrCellGroup_pooling}    ${LO_LO_NrCellGroup}
   Dated Log                       The max number of NR cell group must be worth ${valueToCheck}
   Verify Max Number Of NR Cell Group in CPRT      valueToCheck=${valueToCheck}
   Verify Max Number Of NR Cell Group in L2RT      valueToCheck=${valueToCheck}   nodeToCheck=L2RTa0    fileToCheck=ASP-2730
   Verify Max Number Of NR Cell Group in L2RT      valueToCheck=${valueToCheck}   nodeToCheck=L2RTa1    fileToCheck=ASP-2732


Get BB Pooling status
    [Documentation]                 Check in SCF if BB Pooling is or not activated and return True or False
    ${dist_name}                    set variable        MRBTS-${MRBTS_ID}/NRBTS-${NRBTS_ID}
    ${param_name}                   set variable        actSlowPrbPoolingFddFr1Enh
    ${param_value}                  OAM Get Param From Any Of SCF       param=${param_name}
    ...                                                                 current_scf=${LOG_PATH}/${param.TestName}_SCF_DU_Setup.xml
    ...                                                                 dist_name=${dist_name}
    Dated Log                       Used SCF for check: ${LOG_PATH}/${param.TestName}_SCF_DU_Setup.xml
    Dated Log                       BB Pooling Status : ${param_value}
    [Return]                        ${param_value}


Test Perform Attach
    [Documentation]                 Start the UE Attach on eNB
    FOR     ${ind}      IN RANGE    1   ${NB_CELLS}+1
        UE Attach Enb               ueSetting=${UE_SIMPLE_Cell${ind}}
        Traced Sleep                duration=5s     msg=Workaround for pb Attach Gnb
        UE Attach Gnb               ueSetting=${UE_SIMPLE_Cell${ind}}
        ...                         expected_gnb_log=reported successful RA
    END


Test Verify Attach for 4 UEs on 4 Sectors
    [Documentation]                 Check the UE Attach on Airphone side
    run keyword and ignore error    wait until keyword succeeds    5min    30s
    ...                             Verify AP Classical for UEs attach


Test DL traffic for 4 Ues on 4 Sectors
    [Documentation]                 Generate DownLink Traffic on each UEs
    Traffic UEs DL                  ueSettingList=${UE_SIMPLE_LIST}
    ...                             throughput=3


Test UL traffic for 4 Ues on 4 Sectors
    [Documentation]                 Generate UpLink Traffic on each UEs
    Traffic UEs UL                  ueSettingList=${UE_SIMPLE_LIST}
    ...                             throughput=3


Verify Max Number Of NR Cell Group in CPRT
    [Documentation]                 Check the Number of Cell Groups in startup_cp_rt on ASIK Slave
    [Arguments]                     ${valueToCheck}
    Dated Log New Line              Check the startup_cp_rt.log file:
    ${LogCPRT}                      Container.Get Log                       name=CPRT
    ${alias}                        SSH Connect                             ${LogCPRT.node.host}
    ${CprtLog}                      Set variable                            ${LogCPRT.path.replace('.zip','.*').replace('.log','.*')}
    ${myPattern1}                   Set variable                            TMaxNumberOfNrCellGroup = ${valueToCheck}
    ${myPattern2}                   Set variable                            "maxNumberOfNrCellGroup":${valueToCheck}

    Dated log                       Save CPRT log for debug purpose
    Run Keyword And Ignore Error    SSH Download File
    ...                                 host=${LogCPRT.node.host}
    ...                                 remotePath=${LogCPRT.path}
    ...                                 localPath=${LOG_PATH}/${param.TestName}_startup_cp_rt.log

    Dated log                       Check CPRT Log File=${CprtLog}
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd
    ...                                 ls -lrt ${CprtLog}
    ...                                 alias=${alias}
    ${len}                          Get Length                              ${output}
    Run Keyword If                  ${len} != 0
    ...                             SSH Cmd
    ...                                 unzip -o -d $(dirname ${CprtLog}) ${CprtLog}
    ...                                 alias=${alias}
    Dated log                       CPRT Log Files list is: ${output}
    ${output1}                      SSH Cmd
    ...                                 xzgrep -i "l2RtPoolDeploymentInfo" ${CprtLog}
    ...                                 alias=${alias}
    ${output1} =                    Convert To String                       ${output1}
    Dated log                       case 1: CPRT xzgrep output is: ${output1}

    ${output2}                      SSH Cmd
    ...                                 xzgrep -i -A1 "l2RtPoolDeploymentInfo" ${LogCPRT.path} | xzgrep -A1 maxNumberOfNrCellGroup
    ...                                 alias=${alias}
    ${output2} =                    Convert To String                       ${output2}
    Dated log                       case 2: CPRT xzgrep -A1 output is: ${output2}

    SSH.Disconnect                  connection=${alias}

    ${isFound1}                     Call Method     ${output1}  find    ${myPattern1}
    ${isFound2}                     Call Method     ${output2}  find    ${myPattern1}
    ${isFound3}                     Call Method     ${output1}  find    ${myPattern2}
    ${isFound4}                     Call Method     ${output2}  find    ${myPattern2}

    # Stop action if pattern1 is found:
    Dated log                       Pattern "${myPattern1}" : search results are: ${isFound1} and ${isFound2}
    Return From Keyword If          ${isFound1} > 0 or ${isFound2} > 0
    # Pattern1 is not found : we should find the pattern2
    Dated log                       Pattern "${myPattern2}" : search result are: ${isFound3} and ${isFound4}
    Should be true                  ${isFound3} > 0 or ${isFound4} > 0


Verify Max Number Of NR Cell Group in L2RT
    [Documentation]                 Check the Number of Cell Groups in ASP-27xx_startup file
    [Arguments]                     ${valueToCheck}
    ...                             ${nodeToCheck}
    ...                             ${fileToCheck}
    Dated Log New Line              Check on node_${nodeToCheck} the ${fileToCheck}_startup.* file:
    ${alias}                        SSH Connect                             ${GNB_DU.bb[0].M}
    ${L2rtLog}                      Set variable                            /tmp/node_${nodeToCheck}/tmp/${fileToCheck}_startup.*
    ${ZipLog}                       Set variable                            /tmp/node_${nodeToCheck}/tmp/${fileToCheck}_startup.zip

    ${myPattern1}                   Set variable                            maxNumberOfNrCellGroup=${valueToCheck}
    ${myPattern2}                   Set variable                            maxNumberOfNrCellGroup: ${valueToCheck}

    Dated log                       Check on ${nodeToCheck} this log file=${L2rtLog}
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd
    ...                                 ls -lrt ${L2rtLog}
    ...                                 alias=${alias}
    Dated log                       L2RT Log Files list is: ${output}
    ${len}                          Get Length                              ${output}
    Run Keyword If                  ${len} != 0
    ...                             SSH Cmd
    ...                                 unzip -o -d $(dirname ${ZipLog}) ${ZipLog}
    ...                                 alias=${alias}
    ${output}                       SSH Cmd
    ...                                 xzgrep "maxNumberOfNrCellGroup" ${L2rtLog}
    ...                                 alias=${alias}
    ${output} =                     Convert To String                       ${output}
    Dated log                       L2RT xzgrep output is: ${output}

    SSH.Disconnect                  connection=${alias}

    ${isFound1}                     Call Method     ${output}   find    ${myPattern1}
    ${isFound2}                     Call Method     ${output}   find    ${myPattern2}
    Dated log                       Search of "${myPattern1}" : result is ${isFound1}
    # Stop action if pattern1 is found:
    Return From Keyword If          ${isFound1} > 0
    # Pattern1 is not found : we should find the pattern2
    Dated log                       Search of "${myPattern2}" : result is ${isFound2}
    Should Contain                  ${output}       ${myPattern2}


Verify cell setup per cell
    [Documentation]                 Check the Cell Setup on Airphone side
    Dated log                       Check the startup_l3.log file: zipped or not zipped
    ${output_1}                     SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
    ...                                 command=ls -ltr /tmp/startup_l3.log.xz
    ...                                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    ${output_2}                     SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
    ...                                 command=ls -ltr /tmp/startup_l3.log
    ...                                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    ${lenght_1}                     Get Length                              ${output_1}
    ${length_2}                     Get Length                              ${output_2}
    Dated log                       length_xz:${lenght_1} - lenght_non_xz:${length_2}
    Run Keyword If                  ${lenght_1} != 0                        AP CellSetup log file is zipped
    Run Keyword If                  ${length_2} != 0                        AP CellSetup log file is not zipped


AP CellSetup log file is zipped
    [Documentation]                 Unzip startup_l3 file and extract searched value
    ${output}                       SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
    ...                                 command=xz -d -c /tmp/startup_l3.log.xz|grep RFM_EVENT
    ...                                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    Dated log                       ${output}
    AP CellSetup check pattern      ${output}


AP CellSetup log file is not zipped
    [Documentation]                 Unzip startup_l3 file and extract searched value
    ${output}                       SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
    ...                                 command=grep RFM_EVENT /tmp/startup_l3.log
    ...                                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    Dated log                       ${output}
    AP CellSetup check pattern      ${output}


AP CellSetup check pattern
    [Documentation]                 Search pattern in input parameter
    [Arguments]                     ${output}
    FOR     ${ind}      IN RANGE    1   ${NB_CELLS}+1
        Should Contain              ${output}                   Cell Setup completed for [CELL_ID:${ind}]
        Dated log                   Cell Group ${ind} was successfully configured
    END

Verify AP Classical for UEs attach
    [Documentation]                 Check the UE Attach on Airphone side
