    Run Keyword If                  ${length_2} != 0                        AP UEAttach log file is not zipped


AP UEAttach log file is zipped
    [Documentation]                 Unzip startup_l3 file and extract searched value
    Dated log                       Backup of AP log file: /tmp/startup_l3.log.xz
    ${yyyy}  ${mm}  ${dd}  ${hh}  ${min}  ${ss}=  Get Time  format=year,month,day,hour,min,sec
    ${startup_filename}=            Set Variable  ${yyyy}${mm}${dd}_${hh}${min}${ss}_startup_l3.log.xz
    ${alias_ap}                     SSH Wait For Connect                    ${AP_DU.entryCard[0]}
    csn.download_file               remote_path=/tmp/startup_l3.log.xz
    ...                             local_path=${LOG_PATH}/${startup_filename}
    ...                             connection=${alias_ap}
    ${output}                       SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
    ...                                 command=xz -d -c /tmp/startup_l3.log.xz|grep crnti
    ...                                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    Dated log                       ${output}
    AP UEAttach check pattern      ${output}


AP UEAttach log file is not zipped
    [Documentation]                 Extract searched value from log file
    Dated log                       Backup of AP log file: /tmp/startup_l3.log
    ${yyyy}  ${mm}  ${dd}  ${hh}  ${min}  ${ss}=  Get Time  format=year,month,day,hour,min,sec
    ${startup_filename}=            Set Variable  ${yyyy}${mm}${dd}_${hh}${min}${ss}_startup_l3.log
    ${alias_ap}                     SSH Wait For Connect                    ${AP_DU.entryCard[0]}
    csn.download_file               remote_path=/tmp/startup_l3.log
    ...                             local_path=${LOG_PATH}/${startup_filename}
    ...                             connection=${alias_ap}
    ${output}                       SSH Wait For Connect and Cmd
    ...                                 command=grep crnti /tmp/startup_l3.log
    ...                                 host=${AP_DU.sys[0].M}
    Dated log                       ${output}
    AP UEAttach check pattern      ${output}


AP UEAttach check pattern
    [Documentation]                 Search pattern in input parameter
    [Arguments]                     ${output}
    FOR     ${ind}      IN RANGE    1   ${NB_CELLS}+1
        Should Contain              ${output}        [UE-${ueFsId_${ind}}]: Sm User Ue Connection Established Ind message status OK: crnti=
        Dated log                   5G attach successful for UE ${ind}
    END


Setup 1948
    [Documentation]                 Perform a Suite Setup, then save the delivered SCF
    Suite setup from scratch        listBackupFiles=${FD_ALL}
    Backup All Delivered Config Files


Teardown 1948
    [Documentation]                 Perform a Suite Teardown, then restore all config files (see ${FD_ALL}).
    Setup.Suite Teardown
    Restore Files                   listFileDesc=${FD_ALL}


Test Teardown 1948
    [Documentation]                 Call Scout services, then remove temporary files.
    run keyword and ignore error    Produce Scout Data
    Display diagnosis
    Cleanup Temporary files
    # Go Back To Delivered Configuration
    # As there is only one survival 5GC001966 test in CIT/CRT, I comment the following line:
    # Traced Sleep                    duration= 180s                          msg=inter test


Backup All Delivered Config Files
    [Documentation]                 Saves all initial config files used as an input parameter to MultiCellsCreator.
    # SCF backup:
    ${Delivered_SCF}                OAM Get SCF File
    ...                             file=Delivered_SCF_DU_Setup.xml
    Set Suite Variable              ${Delivered_SCF}
    Dated Log                       Base SCF file will be: ${Delivered_SCF}

    # iphy.xml backup:
    ${Delivered_IPHY}               Set Variable                            ${LOG_PATH}/Delivered_iphy.xml
    Set Suite Variable              ${Delivered_IPHY}
    ${alias_ap}                     SSH Wait For Connect                    ${AP_DU.entryCard[0]}
    csn.download_file               remote_path=/ffs/run/simmode/iphy.xml
    ...                             local_path=${Delivered_IPHY}
    ...                             connection=${alias_ap}
    Dated Log                       Base iphy file will be: ${Delivered_IPHY}

    # basic_wts.cfg backup:
    ${Delivered_BASIC_WTS}          Set Variable                            ${LOG_PATH}/Delivered_basic_wts.cfg
    Set Suite Variable              ${Delivered_BASIC_WTS}
    ${alias_epc}                    SSH Wait For Connect                    ${HOST_EPCSIM}
    csn.download_file               remote_path=${tl.core.dir_path}/${tl.core.cfg_filename}
    ...                             local_path=${Delivered_BASIC_WTS}
    ...                             connection=${alias_epc}
    Dated Log                       Base basic_wts file will be: ${Delivered_BASIC_WTS}


Go Back To Delivered Configuration
    [Documentation]                 Use the Apply Custom Config to go back to delivered config.
    Return from keyword if          ${NoCustomConfig}
    # Copy Delivered iphy.xml file into a temporary file in order to preserve its contain
    OperatingSystem.Run             cp -f ${LOG_PATH}/Delivered_iphy.xml /tmp/Delivered_iphy.xml
    Dated Log                       >>> Go Back To Delivered Config: In progress...
    Apply Custom Config             scfc=${LOG_PATH}/Delivered_SCF_DU_Setup.xml
    ...                             iphy=/tmp/Delivered_iphy.xml
    ...                             cfg=${LOG_PATH}/Delivered_basic_wts.cfg
    Cleanup Temporary files
    Dated Log                       >>> Go Back To Delivered Config: DONE.


Cleanup Temporary files
    [Documentation]                 Remove temporary files created during the Apply Custom Config actions.
    OperatingSystem.Run             rm -f /tmp/Delivered_iphy.xml
    OperatingSystem.Run             rm -f /tmp/iphy.xml


Save Current Configuration
    [Documentation]                 Saves all running config files for debug purpose...
    Dated Log                       Saves all running config files for ${param.TestName}
    # SCF backup:
    ${Running_SCF}                  OAM Get SCF File
    ...                             file=${param.TestName}_SCF_DU_Setup.xml
    # basic_wts.cfg backup:
    ${alias_epc}                    SSH Wait For Connect                    ${HOST_EPCSIM}
    csn.download_file               remote_path=${tl.core.dir_path}/${tl.core.cfg_filename}
    ...                             local_path=${LOG_PATH}/${param.TestName}_basic_wts.cfg
    ...                             connection=${alias_epc}
    # iphy.xml backup:
    ${alias_ap}                     SSH Wait For Connect                    ${AP_DU.entryCard[0]}
    csn.download_file               remote_path=/ffs/run/simmode/iphy.xml
